<pre class="ugsPlain">Gaug   Em6  B7
Summer-time
Em6     B7        Em6  B7 Em6
an' the livin' is easy-y
B7   Em6 Am      C Am7     C      Gdim B    F7 B
Fish are jumpin'   an' the cotton is   high.</pre>
<h6 class="ugsComment">Verse 2: Unrecognized Chords</h6>
<pre class="ugsPlain">Gaug   Gm7b5  B7
Summer-time (whoops! didn't recognize those chords!)
C            B/F
What happens when
D/G     C
Not all slash-chords work</pre>
<h6 class="ugsComment">Verse 3: Chord Blocks</h6>
<pre class="ugsPlain">C   F   G  B7
D  G    C
B  B7</pre>
",
  "diagrams": "",
}
`;

