<pre class="ugsChords">Sometimes a <code data-chordname="D5" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>D5</em> </strong></code>chord only <code data-chordname="F5" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>F5</em> </strong></code>requires two or three notes.</pre>
