<pre class="ugsChords ugsNoLyrics"><code data-chordname="Dm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Dm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code><span class="ugsInlineSpacer">&nbsp;</span><code data-chordname="Gm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Gm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code><span class="ugsInlineSpacer">&nbsp;</span><code data-chordname="Dm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Dm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code><span class="ugsInlineSpacer">&nbsp;</span><code data-chordname="Gm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Gm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code><span class="ugsInlineSpacer">&nbsp;</span><code data-chordname="D7" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>D7</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code></pre>
<h6 class="ugsComment">Verse 1</h6>
<pre class="ugsChords">Topping <code data-chordname="Dm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Dm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>applicake <code data-chordname="Am" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Am</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>gingerbread <code data-chordname="Gm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Gm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>wypas.
<code data-chordname="Dm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Dm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>Donut I love <code data-chordname="Am" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Am</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>caramels donut
Chocolate <code data-chordname="Dm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Dm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>bar wafer <code data-chordname="Am" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Am</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>bonbon lemon <code data-chordname="Gm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Gm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>drops.
Tootsie <code data-chordname="Dm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Dm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>roll carrot <code data-chordname="Am" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Am</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>cake biscuit <code data-chordname="Gm" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Gm</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>cupcake. <code data-chordname="F" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>F</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code></pre>
<div class="ugsChorus">
<h6 class="ugsComment">Chorus</h6>
<pre class="ugsChords"><code data-chordname="Dm7" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Dm7</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>Gummies chocolate cake macaroon.
Muffin <code data-chordname="C" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>C</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>halvah sweet gummi bears
<code data-chordname="G7" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>G7</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>Danish cupcake.
<code data-chordname="Dm7" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>Dm7</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>Sugar plum powder macaroon dragée
Pudding <code data-chordname="C" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>C</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>pudding jelly marzipan.
<code data-chordname="D7" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>D7</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>Liquorice sugar <code data-chordname="C" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>C</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code>plum <code data-chordname="F" style="padding-right: 0px;"><strong> <em>F</em> </strong><span class="ugs-diagrams--chord-img"><svg/></span></code></pre>
</div>
",
