<pre class="ugsPlain">A pen-ny a kiss | A pen-ny a hug</pre>
<h6 class="ugsComment">Mulitple Tab Staffs In One Block</h6>
<pre class="ugsPlain">These begin/end tab block markers wrap two Staffs.
Also, note that the second groups lines are "uneven";
in this case the longest line sets final width/length.</pre>
